    <description>森の茂みに潜む、古代の巨大な蜘蛛型の捕食者。物音を立てず獲物との間合いを詰め、鋭い牙で一気に仕留める。木々の間を苦もなく移動し、逃げる獲物を執拗に追う。\n\nA giant ancient spider-like predator lurking in forest undergrowth. It closes silently on prey before striking with sharp fangs, moving easily through the trees and pursuing anything that flees.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>5.5</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-5</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>42</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.10</ArmorRating_Sharp>
